{"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"openWorldHint":false},"description":"Move a finger: swipe, scroll to an element, drag or pinch. direction: a swipe, from a target if given; up moves content up. until: swipes until that selector is on screen (maxSwipes, 10); x,y: which list. to: drags the target there, no flick; holdMs first lifts a row. scale: pinch, > 1 zooms in. pointers: free paths, one per finger, t in ms. exact: content moves distance and stops. In place: tap_screen. Returns the screen after.","inputSchema":{"properties":{"direction":{"enum":["up","down","left","right"],"type":"string"},"distance":{"type":"number"},"durationMs":{"type":"integer"},"exact":{"type":"boolean"},"holdMs":{"type":"integer"},"maxSwipes":{"type":"integer"},"pointers":{"items":{"items":{"properties":{"t":{"type":"number"},"x":{"type":"number"},"y":{"type":"number"}},"required":["x","y","t"],"type":"object"},"type":"array"},"type":"array"},"read":{"enum":["diff","full","none"],"type":"string"},"ref":{"type":"string"},"scale":{"type":"number"},"selector":{"properties":{"id":{"type":"string"},"index":{"type":"number"},"role":{"type":"string"},"text":{"type":"string"}},"type":"object"},"to":{"properties":{"ref":{"type":"string"},"selector":{"properties":{"id":{"type":"string"},"index":{"type":"number"},"role":{"type":"string"},"text":{"type":"string"}},"type":"object"},"x":{"type":"number"},"y":{"type":"number"}},"type":"object"},"until":{"properties":{"id":{"type":"string"},"index":{"type":"number"},"role":{"type":"string"},"text":{"type":"string"}},"type":"object"},"x":{"type":"number"},"y":{"type":"number"}},"type":"object"},"name":"swipe_screen","title":"Swipe, scroll, drag, pinch"}
